{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id44062160"}, "name":{"label":"hibernaculum"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-07-25T16:02:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.7"}, "id":{"label":"8911621420"}, "title":{"label":"Overcomplicated"}, "content":{"label":"Why are so many podcast apps, SO bad? 🤣\n\nThis one is a classic case of vague menus, too many options, and a failure to grasp the basic needs of a listener. \n\nMenu examples:\n\n“All Episodes” - this doesn’t actually list ALL episodes. So why call it that? What does this menu mean? Why should I even have to ask this question?\n\n“Recent” - recent what? Recent episodes? Recently listened?\n\n“Active” - active what? Actively updated? Actively listened?\n\nI absolutely despise apps with confusing home screen options that seem to require the user to first learn how to use it the way the app designers want you to use it. Instead of offering a clean, natural, logical experience that starts with an answer to the very first question a user is most likely to ask - eg, “what am I currently subscribed to?”\n\nOvercast’s arrogant design completely contradicts the principle of ease of use.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1000572294"}, "name":{"label":"DarcyM2003"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-07-24T01:04:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.7"}, "id":{"label":"8906080242"}, "title":{"label":"Almost Perfect"}, "content":{"label":"Overcast is an app that works extremely well and I think that it just edges out Pockcast as a superior product. However, I do think that Pocket Casts does two things better. Firstly, I think that it's management of the queue is better, and secondly I think its layout of the podcast screen is a bit better. Overall though I'd say it's the superior product, specially those who use a Mac like myself and whom desire to listen to podcasts on there. The Overcasst app completely trounces the (from my experience) often buggy web player for Pocket Casts, as well as being free!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id21884417"}, "name":{"label":"becplumbe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-07-23T13:58:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.6"}, "id":{"label":"8904698363"}, "title":{"label":"Daily user, big fan"}, "content":{"label":"I switched to Overcast when Apple made their native app too annoying to use. I listen to podcasts daily, with a lot of smart lists. Overcast works great and it’s unbelievable to get it for free! \n\nThere are a few things that are buggy, which seem to change each version. At time of writing, “play next” doesn’t work consistently. And sorting gets broken when I move even one thing to out of date order. \n\nI wish there were more sort options beyond old-new and vice versa. Specifically, I really wish there was a “sort by date added” so I could easily find the new episodes of a podcast I added a few days ago but can’t remember the name of! And sometimes I wish there was a “randomise” order, because I have so many interesting episodes to go through that if it’s not really recent or really old (top of either sort order), it’s almost impossible to see and remember to listen.\n\nBut these are minor things, just a wish list! I really like this app and would recommend it to anyone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
